    "description": {
      "original": "面向检测工程师的威胁检测开发方案。覆盖从检测需求梳理到 Sigma 规则编写、目标平台转换草案（Splunk SPL、Microsoft Sentinel KQL、Elastic EQL/ES|QL）、设备原生规则草案、样本回放调优，以及变更与回滚说明的完整链路。目标平台转换草案明确标注「未在目标引擎验证」，需客户在目标环境完成验收。",
      "defaultLocale": "en",
      "locales": {
        "zh-CN": "面向检测工程师的威胁检测开发方案。覆盖从检测需求梳理到 Sigma 规则编写、目标平台转换草案（Splunk SPL、Microsoft Sentinel KQL、Elastic EQL/ES|QL）、设备原生规则草案、样本回放调优，以及变更与回滚说明的完整链路。目标平台转换草案明确标注「未在目标引擎验证」，需客户在目标环境完成验收。",
        "en": "Detection development for detection engineers. Covers the full pipeline from requirements analysis to Sigma rule authoring, target platform translation drafts (Splunk SPL, Microsoft Sentinel KQL, Elastic EQL/ES|QL), native device rule drafts, sample replay and false-positive tuning, and change/rollback notes. Platform translation drafts are explicitly marked 'not validated in target engine' and must be accepted by the customer in their environment."
      }
    }
